Z||000000||BN Boomer||07-07-2000||03:18 PM||||First, have any of the Puget Sound area members heard of this group  - <A HREF="http://www.jetcityfiero.com/" TARGET=_blank>Jet City Fieros</A>. I think I'm going to try to make it to their monthly meeting next Wednesday at the Coco's restaraunt in Overlake and see what they're all about.<P>Secondly, for all Pacific Northwest Members, there is apparently going to be a regional get together known as the <A HREF="http://www.realvision-inc.com/fiero/fest2K.html" TARGET=_blank>Northwest Fiero Fest</A> set to take place first week end of August in Richland, WA. <P>I just found out about these two while searching the 'net after being tipped off to the Jet City Fieros club by another local Fiero owner. It might be a little late notice for the Fiero Fest, but I'm going to talk to the wife about trying to make it for at least part of the event.<p>[This message has been edited by BN Boomer (edited 07-07-2000).]||||reg||1
